<h2>Belay 1.8.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>See stats for each project.</b> Double-click a session in Statistics
      to see agent time, sessions, tokens and recent runs for that folder.</li>
  <li><b>Background tasks hold more reliably.</b> Late or duplicate hook
      events no longer end a hold early or restart one after release.</li>
  <li><b>Hooks recover after an interrupted quit.</b> If Belay is killed while
      closing, it restores its agent settings on the next launch.</li>
  <li><b>The diagnostics log stays small.</b> Once it passes 3&nbsp;MB, Belay
      trims it back to the most recent 1&nbsp;MB.</li>
</ul>
<p class="quiet">Also: Sessions now keeps the latest 100 runs, and its headline
shows total agent time instead of the number of rows.</p>]]></description>
