<h2>Belay 1.6.3</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Precise Detection survives restarts and updates.</b> Belay now keeps
      the same local address, so agents stay connected when the app restarts
      or updates.</li>
  <li><b>Option reveals the longer choices too.</b> In Sleep delay and the
      Always On timer, hold Option or Shift to show the longer durations.</li>
</ul>
<p class="quiet">Also: diagnostics now record when the local bridge starts,
which port it uses, and which agent settings it updates.</p>]]></description>
